    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "grafana-echartsrelations-panel",
      "title": "Control \u2014 no mappings",
      "description": "**The baseline.** Node values are the raw numbers `1`, `2`, `3` \u2014 which say nothing. Each node field carries one sample, so the default `median` reducer (`RELATIONS_CALC_DEFAULT`) returns that sample unchanged.\n\nCompare every panel to the right of this one against it.",
