    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "grafana-echartsrelations-panel",
      "title": "Range \u2192 text on an edge weight",
      "description": "**Mappings work on edges too, and reach the edge label.** The three request rates (`120`, `80`, `45`) are mapped by range to `saturated`, `busy` and `light`, drawn on the links themselves.\n\nNo `editorMode` needed. \"Show edge values\" is a Default-tier option in the **Edges** section, so the switch is reachable \u2014 and its stored value survives \u2014 without putting the panel in Advanced mode. It was Advanced, and this panel had to set `editorMode: advanced` or `applyEditorModeDefaults` would reset the switch at render time and the labels would silently not draw.\n\nNote the mappings are on the **edges** query only; the nodes keep their numbers.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-testdata-datasource",
        "uid": "trlxrdZVk"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*-->.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "range",
                    "options": {
                      "from": 0,
                      "to": 50,
                      "result": {
                        "text": "light",
                        "index": 0
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "range",
                    "options": {
                      "from": 50,
                      "to": 100,
                      "result": {
                        "text": "busy",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "range",
                    "options": {
                      "from": 100,
                      "to": 100000,
                      "result": {
                        "text": "saturated",
                        "index": 2
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        },
        "seriesType": "graph",
        "relationsLayout": "circular",
        "relationsShowEdgeValues": true
