    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "grafana-echartsrelations-panel",
      "title": "Special \u2192 text on a null node stat (what does NOT happen)",
      "description": "**The honest case, and why the \"No value\" standard option is unregistered here.**\n\n`api` reports no sample at all. A `SpecialValueMatch` mapping for `null` **does** fire \u2014 the mapping is applied by the display processor, which runs whether or not the panel asks it to. But the relations family never asks: `buildRelationsTooltipModel` omits the value row outright when a node's stat is null, and the node label falls back to the bare name. Both are deliberate \u2014 an empty value under a `Value` label reads as a measurement that failed rather than one that was never taken.\n\nSo `api` shows a name and no value line, and the mapped text `unreported` appears nowhere. That unreachability is exactly why `FieldConfigProperty.NoValue` is in `RELATIONS_DISABLED_FIELD_OPTIONS`: it could only ever have applied to a case the family does not render. The edge half of the same gap is still open \u2014 see `todo/relations-null-edge-weight.md`.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-testdata-datasource",
        "uid": "trlxrdZVk"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 11
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "text": "unreported",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "Healthy",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "2": {
                  "text": "Degraded",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "3": {
                  "text": "Down",
                  "index": 2
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        },
        "seriesType": "graph",
        "relationsLayout": "circular",
        "relationsShowNodeValues": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-testdata-datasource",
            "uid": "trlxrdZVk"
          },
          "scenarioId": "csv_content",
